    "rationale": "Manual validation applied from the checklist because scripts could not be run. Present risk is dominated by a TC1 path from untrusted inbound email to broad CRM read and irreversible external email send. The only declared preventive control on that path is a prompt instruction, so residual falls one tier from critical to high. Forecast returns to critical under model upgrade or longer task horizon because the sole preventive control is dependent and the model is swappable without separate review. Additional gaps include broad shared-service credentials, lack of approval gating for sensitive outbound mail, and unpinned MCP definitions."
